            </note>
            <note corresp="#d396-f2" n="1" xml:id="d396-f2-content">
                <p>A memorandum of the conversation at the Deputies Coordinating Group meeting at 10
                    a.m., US/MC/104, is <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, Conference Files: Lot 64
                    D 560, CF 1376; a copy of the French draft from which they worked is <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid.;</hi> for text of the paper as presented to
                    Gromyko later that day, see <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Ministers
                        Meeting</hi>, pp. 312–313; <hi rendition="#italic">Cmd.</hi> 868, pp.
                    237–238; or <hi rendition="#italic">Documents on Germany, 1944–1985</hi>, pp.
                    665–666.</p>
